      "evidence": "The unit repeatedly states that a retry of the same operation ID returns its original result and that a new ID means a distinct action, then asks which retry identity to use. i014 states the exact same-ID invoice result/no-double-charge rule; the keyed choice repeats returning that result for that same ID. i002 and i010 similarly supply the keyed same-ID behavior.",
